[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12422.309, "timestamp": "03:27:02", "text": "就像你一样，把它表达出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12425.95, "timestamp": "03:27:05", "text": "想想哪里出了问题"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12428.309, "timestamp": "03:27:08", "text": "东西。是的。你为什么不能这样做？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12429.75, "timestamp": "03:27:09", "text": "所有那些东西？是的。他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12432.15, "timestamp": "03:27:12", "text": "和他们好好谈谈，建立良好的相互关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12433.79, "timestamp": "03:27:13", "text": "沟通与"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12435.99, "timestamp": "03:27:15", "text": "理解了，他们就会发推文。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12438.07, "timestamp": "03:27:18", "text": "你知道，而且你会注意到，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12441.429, "timestamp": "03:27:21", "text": "毕业什么的。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12443.83, "timestamp": "03:27:23", "text": "根据你的决定。就像他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12445.63, "timestamp": "03:27:25", "text": "无法移除你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12449.59, "timestamp": "03:27:29", "text": "除非你还没记住，否则请记住这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12453.15, "timestamp": "03:27:33", "text": "违反了任何特定规则"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12455.429, "timestamp": "03:27:35", "text": "机构，你做得很好，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12457.55, "timestamp": "03:27:37", "text": "但由于某些原因，你必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12460.11, "timestamp": "03:27:40", "text": "离开，这是你的最后一次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12463.51, "timestamp": "03:27:43", "text": "决定之后，他们会把它写下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12465.59, "timestamp": "03:27:45", "text": "这样他们就会接受。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12467.91, "timestamp": "03:27:47", "text": "他们会很难过看到你离开，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12469.75, "timestamp": "03:27:49", "text": "他们仍然会尊重你的决定"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12472.55, "timestamp": "03:27:52", "text": "是的，我们在11号展厅已经看到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12473.95, "timestamp": "03:27:53", "text": "山治相当"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12477.11, "timestamp": "03:27:57", "text": "很多。是的。"}]